# Local access codes
.env
.env.*

# Trained weights come from the Kaggle notebook and are too large for git (the ConvNeXt file alone is
# over GitHub's 100 MB limit); see models/README.md. The small files the web pages and the documentation
# read (config, metrics, site thresholds, reports, figures) are tracked.
models/*.pt
models/*.onnx
models/onnx/
models_run*/

# Kaggle downloads and executed copies of the notebook (named notebook<hex>.ipynb by Kaggle).
# The source notebook, Fundalux_Kaggle_Training.ipynb, is tracked.
*.zip
notebook*.ipynb

# Clinicians' answers belong to the study, not the code
review/responses.sqlite3*
review.old/
review.new/
